  "description": "A dimming actuator drives a tunable white light. Keys 1 to 3 send a colour temperature with DPT 7.600 (2700 K warm, 4000 K neutral, 6500 K cold); the numeric fields send a level (DPT 5.001) and any colour temperature. Requests outside the 2700–6500 K range of the channel are limited to it, and the actuator reports the applied value.",
